WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.169
They've known everything for years.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.589
And it's amazing, isn't it,
how anyone who disagrees with them

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:10.427
has got to be just... crazy.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:18.852
Lieutenant Shaw reporting as ordered, Sir.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:22.731
What’s the fight even about?
I guess I just can't abide bullies, sir.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.817
So your father threw a few punches
in his day.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.944
Some of them at me.

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:29.988
some orders have come through.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:33.199
Security escort for a Japanese scientist.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.117
I'm so sorry, sir.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.410
A Japanese scientist?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.954
I think you’re here for me.

00:00:37.954 --> 00:00:42.459
You'd like me to drive?
Why?

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.461
Am I'm making you nervous?

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:46.671
It's impressive.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:50.675
Doesn't that make you
a little overqualified for this snipe hunt?

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:51.885
This what?

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.429
Wild goose chase,

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:57.974
Help! Hurry!

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.559
Help! Come on!

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.313
Oh my God!

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:04.647
Oh my God.

00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:05.815
Help me get him out.

00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:07.400
C’mon!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.194
Before it comes back.

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:18.620
It is a dragon.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:24.000
You want to do some serious science,
then we need backing.

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:25.919
Welcome to Monarch, General.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:29.798
If we hide who we are
and what we're trying to do then....

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.341
What’s the point of doing it at all?

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:37.972
Kei,

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:38.431
It's over.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.307
It's over.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.111
They don't trust either of us.

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.695
I don't care.

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:58.034
Yes, you do.

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:06.626
Oh my God.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:14.551
Why would he have that in this file?

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:18.763
We didn't kill it.

00:02:26.563 --> 00:02:27.730
Oh my God.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.066
Oh my God!

00:02:30.066 --> 00:02:31.484
Go, go, go!

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.404
Reach, Kei!

00:02:35.071 --> 00:02:36.114
Reach!

00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:43.496
You-

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.707
don't have to do this.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.171
Mayday! Mayday!

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:53.965
Mayday! Mayday!

00:03:09.272 --> 00:03:11.524
I told you I've been here before.

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:13.693
I made it back.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:15.945
Get me Bill Randa!

00:03:15.945 --> 00:03:20.575
You disappeared during Operation
Hourglass in 1962.

00:03:20.617 --> 00:03:23.369
20 years ago

00:03:23.828 --> 00:03:27.874
Gestation will last about five and a half months
for the majority…

00:03:27.957 --> 00:03:30.501
I tell you the truth,
You're just going to think I'm crazy.

00:03:30.501 --> 00:03:34.714
Adventure
now begins as it searches for sources.

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:38.176
We interrupt this program,
to bring you breaking news.

00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:50.230
Colonel Shaw?

00:03:53.608 --> 00:03:56.778
We can get the hell out of here right now
and find out what really happened

00:03:56.778 --> 00:04:00.281
with your dad.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.159
Oh my God!

00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:04.035
Stop!

00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:08.623
Come on, baby.
Stop!

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:13.586
Here we go.

00:04:17.799 --> 00:04:20.468
Everybody in one piece back there?

00:04:20.551 --> 00:04:21.469
Kentaro!

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:22.470
Run!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.763
Come on, Get on the rock.

00:04:25.723 --> 00:04:28.309
Wait, what happened to your centuries
of experience?

00:04:28.309 --> 00:04:30.603
It's a Titan, May.

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:32.563
They’re like snowflakes.

00:04:32.563 --> 00:04:34.565
Never came across two that were the same.

00:04:34.565 --> 00:04:36.943
We build a bonfire,
we feed it .

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:38.069
Dinner time, you son of a b*tch.

00:04:38.069 --> 00:04:39.195
Dinner time, you son of a b*tch.

00:04:44.575 --> 00:04:45.201
Go!

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:54.627
The world is on fire.

00:04:54.711 --> 00:04:56.879
I decided to do something about it.

00:04:57.213 --> 00:04:58.589
Mmm-Hmm.

00:04:58.881 --> 00:05:01.175
You want to help?

00:05:01.175 --> 00:05:04.095
Monarch is wrong.

00:05:13.271 --> 00:05:16.357
I think you and
I have a lot to talk about.

00:05:16.858 --> 00:05:18.109
Come with me.

00:05:18.109 --> 00:05:20.528
And you’ll know everything, I promise you.

00:05:20.528 --> 00:05:22.989
My name is Colonel Leland

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:25.199
Lafayette Shaw The Third

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:28.619
and your base is now under my control.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:31.998
Sir. Look-

00:05:37.211 --> 00:05:38.838
Yes!

00:05:39.589 --> 00:05:42.091
Exactly what do you think you’ll find in there?

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:44.260
Reach, Kei!

00:05:46.387 --> 00:05:47.972
It won't be for the faint of heart.

00:05:47.972 --> 00:05:49.015
I can tell you that.

00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:51.976
So that's why you want to seal off their world.

00:05:51.976 --> 00:05:55.188
I am sealing off their world.

00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:56.981
Every portal.

00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:06.616
I got you!

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:09.118
Don’t let go of me!

00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:11.496
Cate!

